# SPA fallback (Netlify).
#
# Movway routes client-side, so a hard load of /watch/tv/1399 asks the host for
# a file that does not exist. Without this rule Netlify answers 404 — which is
# exactly what a reload on a movie or series page used to produce. Serve
# index.html for anything that is not a real file and let the router take over.
#
# Vite copies public/ verbatim into dist/, so this ships with every build.
/*    /index.html   200
